### trying to escape a quote inside single quotes
echo 'It\''s late'
>>> SC1003 1:9

### value ending in an escaped quote
greeting='hello world\'
echo "$greeting"
>>> SC1003 1:22

### backslash followed by a letter in single quotes
echo 'C:\Users\guest'
>>> none

### backslash followed by a digit in single quotes
sed 's/\(x\)/\1/' input.txt
>>> none
